      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T20:38:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this is intended. `mFilterIndexStack` represents the available filter slots of the controller. As a result, they are claimed when adding new monitors, and released back into the available list when removing monitors.",
